  "steps": [
    "Preheat oven to 350°F. Spray 9 muffin cups with nonstick spray.",
    "Beat shortening, 1/2 cup sugar, and egg until smooth. Combine flour, baking powder, salt, and nutmeg; add to sugar mixture alternately with milk.",
